--- pathed edit
# PATH, one directory per line: the first is searched first. Move a line to move
# the directory, delete it to take it out of PATH, add one to add it (~ is your
# home; '' is the empty entry, the current directory). A line that starts with #
# is ignored, and so is a note after "  #".
# Save and quit to apply; leave the file as it is, or empty it, to leave PATH alone.
~/new
~/one
''     # empty: the current directory
PATH unchanged
